  "body": "Positioned in one of Kensington Park's most sought-after settings, 77 Parkside Drive offers a rare opportunity to secure a newly renovated and very spacious home with beautiful uninterrupted lake views and all-day north-west sun.\r\n\r\nAt 147sqm, this is one of the Park's largest apartment floor plans, offering the space and flexibility that makes everyday living feel easy. From the moment you step inside, there is an immediate sense of openness, with generous open-plan living flowing naturally out to the sunny north-west aspect.\r\n\r\nOverlooking the lake and beautifully landscaped grounds, the outlook is peaceful and private, with views extending towards Eaves Bush. It's a home that combines space, light and a wonderful connection to its surroundings - all in one of Kensington Park's most desirable positions.\r\n\r\nRecently renovated, the home has undergone a high-quality transformation where every detail has been carefully considered and reimagined. The brand-new kitchen forms a striking center piece, anchored by a generous island that naturally becomes a place to gather, entertain, and connect. The living environment is exceptional in both scale and flexibility, incorporating defined spaces for dining, relaxed lounge living, and informal entertaining-perfect for both everyday living and hosting.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is equally well considered, with two generously proportioned bedrooms offering excellent separation and storage. The master suite enjoys a peaceful lake outlook and features a walk-in wardrobe and a refined ensuite with double vanities. The second bedroom is thoughtfully designed with extensive built-in storage and an integrated desk/office space that can be closed away-ideal for working from home without compromising the living environment.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include two secure basement car parks, a dedicated lock-up storage unit, lift access, and the inherent benefits of Kensington Park's established, master-planned environment-offering a secure, lock-and-leave lifestyle just moments from Orewa Beach, Eaves Bush walkways, and Orewa village amenities.\r\n\r\nThis is a tightly held position within the Park, and opportunities of this caliber are limited.  \r\n\r\nContact us to arrange a private viewing or visit the Sales Suite Wednesday to Sunday 10am to 2pm to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nKensington Park Realty, Licensed REAA 2008.",
